### Without the admin key, expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{"icao24": "aaaaaa", "callsign": "TEST"}

### With the admin key, expect 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: test-key

{"icao24": "aaaaaa", "callsign": "TEST"}